<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "If the court orders that the aided person is to receive any money which is less than ten thousand ringgit, the aided person is not liable to make any payment to the Director General as advocacy costs."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
