<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If the court orders that the aided person is to receive any money which is more than ten thousand ringgit, the aided person shall pay to the Director General one quarter of the amount ordered but not exceeding ten thousand ringgit as advocacy costs which is to be deposited into a trust account."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
