<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "If the court orders that the aided person is to receive any property valued at more than ten thousand ringgit as assessed in the proceedings, the aided person shall pay to the Director General an amount not exceeding ten percent of the said property value as advocacy costs which is to be deposited into the trust account."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
