<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "If the court affirms an award granted by a quasi-judicial body, the aided person shall pay to the Director General an amount not exceeding ten percent of the amount of the award as advocacy costs which is to be deposited into the trust account."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
