<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General may, with the approval of the Minister, waive or allow a reduction of any payment that may be imposed under subsection (5), (6) or (7) if the imposition of the payment may cause undue hardship on the aided person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
