<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An application by a person or an aided person who wishes to obtain mediation services shall be made to the Director General in such manner as may be determined by the Director General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
