<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An application under subsection (1) shall be accompanied by such information, particulars or documents as may be determined by the Director General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
