<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "After considering the application, the Director General may approve the provision of mediation services to the applicant and may provide mediation services to the applicant in accordance with the regulations prescribed by the Minister."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
