<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_44__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "If the applicant is a child, the application shall be made on behalf of the child by his parents or guardian and any reference to the applicant in this Chapter shall include the parents or guardian of the child. Reference to mediation by Director General"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
