<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_45> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General may, if he thinks necessary, refer any person, applicant or aided person under Chapters 2 and 3 of Part III to mediation services by giving a notice orally, or through electronic service or remote communication technology requiring such person to make an application for mediation services under section 44. Mediator"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
