<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_46__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may appoint any person as a mediator for the purposes of this Chapter."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
