<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_46__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Every mediator appointed under subsection (1) shall be subject to the general supervision and directions of the Director General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_46__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_46> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
