<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~part_III__chp_5__cl_46__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The mediator appointed under this section shall not appear and plead in any court to represent any person who is a party to the mediation session conducted by him for the same dispute arising in such mediation session."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
