<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@/~sched_5> <https://schema.org/text> "[Section 56] DESCRIPTION OF CRIMINAL PROCEEDINGS IN RESPECT OF WHICH PUBLIC DEFENCE SERVICES MAY NOT BE PROVIDED (1) (2) No. Proceedings 1. Charges for criminal offences punishable with the death penalty or imprisonment for life 2. Charges for criminal offences under Chapters VI, VIa and VIb of the Penal Code [Act 574] except for a child offender 3. Charges for criminal offences involving child victims"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/eng@> .
